            extended-nh-encoding label-ipv4
exit
```

Replace `<group-name>` with your BGP group name and `<peer-ip-address>` with the IP address of your BGP peer. 

The `family label-ipv4` enables the labeled IPv4 address family, `advertise-ldp-prefix` allows advertising LDP FEC prefixes, and `extended-nh-encoding label-ipv4` ensures proper next-hop encoding for labeled IPv4 routes.
