To configure Nokia routers to allow LLGR stale routes to be advertised to all peers so they can exit the local AS, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp graceful-restart
    long-lived
        advertise-stale-to-all-neighbors without-no-export
    exit
exit
```

This configuration enables long-lived graceful restart and advertises stale routes to all neighbors, including those that didn't advertise LLGR capability, allowing the routes to exit the local AS.
