To configure a Nokia router to use infinity as the default MED value for BGP path selection when comparing routes with missing MED attributes, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    best-path-selection
        always-compare-med infinity
    exit
exit
```

This configuration ensures that routes without a MED attribute will be treated as having a value of infinity (2³²-1), making them the least preferred in the path selection process.
