1. Enter the global configuration mode:
```
configure
```

2. Access the BMP configuration context:
```
bmp
```

From here, you can proceed to configure BMP stations, connections, and other related parameters as needed. For example, to set up a BMP station and its connection details, you would continue with:
```
station <station-name>
connection
router <router-instance>
exit
exit
```
