To set the BGP Connect Retry timer to 90 seconds on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router bgp
    connect-retry 90
exit
```

Alternatively, if you need to configure it at the group or neighbor level:
```
configure router bgp group <group-name>
    connect-retry 90
exit
```

or 

```
configure router bgp group <group-name> neighbor <ip-address>
    connect-retry 90
exit
```
