exit
```

Replace `<group-name>` with your BGP peer group name, `<ip-prefix/prefix-length>` with the network prefix from which to accept dynamic neighbors, and `<peers>` with the maximum number of dynamic sessions allowed for this group (1-8192).

Optionally, you can add:
