How to configure Nokia router's BGP best path selection to treat EBGP and IBGP routes equally for labeled unicast IPv6 routes?
---
## Proposed answer:
To configure your Nokia router's BGP best path selection to treat EBGP and IBGP routes equally for labeled unicast IPv6 routes, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    best-path-selection
        ebgp-ibgp-equal label-ipv6
    exit
exit
```

This configuration will enable equal treatment of EBGP and IBGP routes during best path selection specifically for labeled IPv6 unicast routes.
