To configure a Nokia router for VPN route exchange between different autonomous systems in BGP, use the following CLI commands:

```cli
configure router bgp
    enable-inter-as-vpn
    enable-rr-vpn-forwarding
exit
```

These commands will:
1. Enable VPN route exchange across autonomous system boundaries (`enable-inter-as-vpn`)
2. Allow all received VPN-IP routes to be processed and forwarded between BGP peers (`enable-rr-vpn-forwarding`)
