To configure your Nokia router for VPN route exchange between different autonomous systems under BGP, use the following commands:

```
configure router bgp
    enable-inter-as-vpn
    enable-rr-vpn-forwarding
    vpn-apply-import
    next-hop-resolution
        labeled-routes
            transport-tunnel
                family vpn
                    resolution-filter
                        rsvp-te
                        sr-te
                        ldp
                    exit
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
exit
```

These commands will:
1. Enable inter-AS VPN functionality
2. Allow VPN-IP route forwarding through the RR
3. Apply BGP import policies to VPN routes
4. Configure next-hop resolution for VPN routes using RSVP-TE, SR-TE, and LDP tunnel
