To configure BGP graceful restart support for NOTIFICATION messages in a BGP group on a Nokia router, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    group <group-name>
        graceful-restart
            enable-notification
        exit
    exit
exit
```

Replace `<group-name>` with the name of your BGP group. This configuration enables the router to indicate support for graceful restart during NOTIFICATION messages within the specified BGP group.
