To configure your Nokia router to import all received VPN-IP routes into the dummy VRF for BGP next-hop resolution, use the following CLI commands:

```cli
configure router bgp
    enable-rr-vpn-forwarding
    next-hop-resolution
        labeled-routes
            transport-tunnel family vpn
                bgp
            exit
        exit
    exit
exit
```

This configuration:
1. Enables VPN-IP route forwarding to the dummy VRF (`enable-rr-vpn-forwarding`)
2. Configures BGP-labeled routes for next-hop resolution
3. Specifies VPN address family for transport tunnel resolution
4. Enables BGP tunneling for next-hop resolution of VPN routes
