To configure your Nokia router to import all received VPN-IP routes into the dummy VRF for BGP next-hop resolution regardless of route targets, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    enable-rr-vpn-forwarding
    exit
```

If you also need to ensure proper next-hop resolution for VPN routes, you may want to configure the transport tunnel settings under BGP next-hop resolution. For example:

```
configure router bgp next-hop-resolution labeled-routes transport-tunnel family vpn
    bgp
    exit
exit
```

These commands will enable the forwarding of all VPN-IP routes to the dummy VRF and configure BGP tunneling for next-hop resolution of VPN routes.
