To verify that the last ASN in the AS_PATH of all routes received from an EBGP peer matches the configured `peer-as` value, use the following command under the BGP group or neighbor configuration:

```
configure router bgp
    group <group-name>
        enforce-first-as
exit
```

Or at the neighbor level:
```
configure router bgp
    group <group-name>
        neighbor <ip-address>
