To enable updated BGP error handling procedures on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

1. At the global BGP level:
```
configure router bgp
    error-handling
exit
```

2. Alternatively, at the BGP group or neighbor level if needed:
```
configure router bgp group <group-name>
    error-handling
exit
```

or

```
configure router bgp group <group-name> neighbor <ip-address>
    error-handling
exit
```
