Generate CLI configuration commands that fulfill the user's request using the information from the reference content. Please respond directly to the user's question. Do not mention phrases like "based on the information you provided", "according to the documentation", or anything similar.
To configure Nokia routers to support both IPv6 unicast (labeled) and EVPN address families in BGP, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    family label-ipv6 evpn
exit
```

This enables both the labeled IPv6 unicast and EVPN address families in the BGP configuration. The configuration can be applied at the global BGP level, group level, or neighbor level depending on your specific requirements.
