To configure long-lived graceful restart for the flow-ipv6 family on a Nokia router, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    graceful-restart
        long-lived
            family flow-ipv6
        exit
    exit
exit
```

If you also want to set specific parameters like stale-routes-time or restart-time, you can include them as follows:

```
configure router bgp
    graceful-restart
        stale-routes-time 1800
        restart-time 600
        long-lived
            family flow-ipv6
        exit
    exit
exit
```
