To configure next-hop-resolution options for VPN-IPv4 and VPN-IPv6 routes when they are not imported into any VPRN service, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        labeled-routes
            transport-tunnel
                family vpn
                    enable
                    exit
                exit
            exit
        exit
    enable-rr-vpn-forwarding
exit
```

Additionally, if you need to advertise the capability to receive VPN-IPv4 routes from peers, include:

```
configure router bgp
    extended-nh-encoding vpn-ipv4
exit
```
