To configure next-hop-resolution options for VPN-IPv4 and VPN-IPv6 routes when they are not imported into any VPRN service, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    enable-rr-vpn-forwarding
    next-hop-resolution
        labeled-routes
            transport-tunnel
                family vpn
                    exit
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
exit
```

Additionally, if you need to enable extended next-hop encoding for VPN-IPv4 routes with specific peers, you can configure:

```
configure router bgp
    extended-nh-encoding vpn-ipv4
    exit
```

Or at the group/neighbor level:

```
configure router bgp group <group-name>
    extended-nh-encoding vpn-ipv4
    exit
```
