To configure a Nokia router to report both IPv6 unicast (labeled) and IPv4 VPN (SAFI 128) address families to a BMP monitoring station, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure
    bmp
        station "BMP_STATION_NAME"
            family label-ipv6 vpn-ipv4
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

Replace `"BMP_STATION_NAME"` with the name of your BMP monitoring station. This configuration enables the reporting of labeled IPv6 unicast (`label-ipv6`) and IPv4 VPN (`vpn-ipv4`) address families to the specified BMP station.
