To enable BGP load balancing for multiple paths with identical IGP metrics on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router bgp
    multipath 8
    ibgp-multipath
    best-path-selection
        ebgp-ibgp-equal ipv4 ipv6
    exit
```

This configuration:
1. Enables BGP multipath with up to 8 parallel paths (`multipath 8`)
2. Allows IBGP multipath load balancing (`ibgp-multipath`)
3. Treats EBGP and IBGP paths equally for load balancing purposes (`ebgp-ibgp-equal`)

The `multipath 8` value can be adjusted based on your specific requirements (valid range is 1-64). The `ebgp-ibgp-equal` command includes both IPv4 and IPv6 address families by default.
