To enable load balancing for multiple IBGP paths with equal cost on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router bgp
    multipath 64 ibgp 64
    ibgp-multipath
exit
```

These commands will:
1. Enable BGP multipath with a maximum of 64 paths for both general and IBGP-specific cases
2. Specifically enable IBGP multipath load balancing

If you want to include additional options like allowing static routes or backup paths, you can extend the configuration with:

```
configure router bgp
    multipath 64 ibgp 64
    ibgp-multipath
    next-hop-resolution labeled-routes
        allow-static
    exit
    backup-path ipv4 ipv6
exit
```
------------
