To configure a Nokia router to exclude BGP router ID comparison for MVPN IPv6 paths during best path selection, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp best-path-selection
    ignore-router-id include-internal mvpn-ipv6
exit
```

This configuration will prevent the router from comparing BGP router IDs when selecting the best path for MVPN IPv6 routes.
