```
configure router bgp
import "NYC_Filter AND Chicago_Prefix"
exit
```

This will apply both the "NYC_Filter" policy and the "Chicago_Prefix" expression as conditions for inbound route filtering. The policies must already exist in your `config>router>policy-options` context.
