To configure your Nokia router's BGP to apply the route policy "cust123-inbound-filter" for incoming routes from a specific peer, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    group <group-name>
        neighbor <peer-IP-address>
            import "cust123-inbound-filter"
```

Replace `<group-name>` with your BGP group name and `<peer-IP-address>` with the IP address of the specific peer. The quotes around the policy name are optional unless the name contains special characters.
