## Proposed answer:
To configure a custom welcome message for BMP station connections on a Nokia router, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure
bmp
station "BMP_STATION_NAME"
connection
description "Maintenance Contact: support@example.com, Phone: +1-555-1234567"
exit
exit
exit
```

Replace `"BMP_STATION_NAME"` with your actual BMP station name. The description field will display the specified message upon connection establishment.
