```
configure router bgp add-paths
    ipv4 send 8 receive
exit
```

This configuration enables the BGP add-paths capability for unlabeled IPv4 unicast routes, sets the maximum advertised paths to 8 per prefix, and negotiates to receive multiple routes per prefix.
