Generate CLI configuration commands that fulfill the user's request using the information from the reference content. Please respond directly to the user's question. Do not mention phrases like "based on the information you provided", "according to the documentation", or anything similar.
To configure your Nokia router to advertise up to 8 paths per unlabeled IPv4 unicast prefix and negotiate to receive multiple routes per prefix, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure
router
    bgp
        add-paths
            ipv4 send 8 receive
        exit
    exit
exit
```

This configuration enables BGP add-paths for unlabeled IPv4 unicast routes, sets the maximum advertised paths to 8 per prefix, and enables negotiation to receive multiple routes per prefix.
