To configure a Nokia router to advertise up to 8 labeled-unicast IPv6 paths per prefix and negotiate to receive multiple paths, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    add-paths
        label-ipv6 send 8 receive
    exit
exit
```

If you want to enable BGP fast reroute for labeled-unicast IPv6 routes as well, add:
```
configure router bgp
    backup-path label-ipv6
exit
```
