To enable LDP tunneling for next-hop resolution of BGP labeled routes on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration:

```
configure router
    bgp
        next-hop-resolution
            labeled-routes
                transport-tunnel
                    family ipv4
                        resolution-filter ldp
                    exit
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

This configuration enables LDP as the tunnel type for resolving next-hops of BGP labeled IPv4 routes. The `resolution-filter` command under the IPv4 family specifies LDP as the allowed tunnel type.
