exit
```

Replace `<group-name>`, `<remote-peer-as-number>`, `<neighbor-ip-address>`, and `<local-ip-address>` with your specific values. This configuration sets the local AS to 65535 and ensures both the local and global AS numbers are hidden in paths announced to the peer.
