Here are the CLI configuration commands to configure a Nokia router with local AS number 65535, including both `private` and `no-prepend-global-as` options for BGP:

```
configure router bgp
    local-as 65535 private no-prepend-global-as
exit
```

If you also need to enable the removal of private AS numbers globally (as mentioned in your request), add the following command under the same context:
```
configure router bgp
    remove-private
exit
```
