If you need to apply this configuration at the BGP group or neighbor level instead of globally, use one of these alternatives:

For a specific BGP group:
```
configure router bgp group <group-name> add-paths
    mcast-vpn-ipv6 send 8 receive none
exit
```

For a specific BGP neighbor:
```
configure router bgp group <group-name> neighbor <ip-address> add-paths
    mcast-vpn-ipv6 send 8 receive none
exit
```
