To configure your Nokia router to advertise up to 8 multicast IPv6 VPN paths per prefix and negotiate to receive multiple routes, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    add-paths
        mcast-vpn-ipv6 send 8 receive
    exit
exit
```

This configuration enables the BGP add-paths capability for multicast IPv6 VPN routes, setting the maximum number of advertised paths to 8 per prefix and enabling negotiation to receive multiple routes.
