To configure a Nokia router to advertise the MED path attribute with a value of 15000 when it's not already set in BGP, use the following CLI command:

```
configure router bgp
    med-out 15000
exit
```

This command can also be applied at the group or neighbor level if needed:

For a specific BGP group:
```
configure router bgp group <group-name>
    med-out 15000
exit
```

For a specific BGP neighbor:
```
configure router bgp group <group-name> neighbor <ip-address>
    med-out 15000
exit
```
