To configure your Nokia router to advertise up to 8 different paths per multicast VPN IPv4 prefix and negotiate to receive multiple paths from BGP peers, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    add-paths
        mcast-vpn-ipv4 send 8 receive
exit all
```

This configuration enables both sending (up to 8 paths) and receiving capabilities for multicast VPN IPv4 routes at the global BGP level. You can also apply this configuration at the BGP group or neighbor level if needed.
