To configure your Nokia router to advertise up to 8 different paths per multicast VPN IPv4 prefix and disable receiving multiple paths from peers, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    add-paths
        mvpn-ipv4 send 8 receive none
exit all
```

This configuration will enable the advertising of up to 8 paths per multicast VPN IPv4 prefix while explicitly disabling the reception of multiple paths from peers.
