To enable inter-AS label security for both VPN IPv4 and VPN IPv6 families on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router bgp
    neighbor-trust vpn-ipv4 vpn-ipv6
    enable-inter-as-vpn
exit
```

These commands will configure the router to apply label security for VPN IPv4 and VPN IPv6 prefixes at inter-AS boundaries while enabling inter-AS VPN route exchange.
