To configure a Nokia router to enable BGP peer acceptance of filter lists for outbound routes, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    outbound-route-filtering
        extended-community
            accept-orf
exit exit
```

If you need to apply this to a specific BGP group or neighbor, use these variations:

For a BGP group:
```
configure router bgp group <group-name>
    outbound-route-filtering
        extended-community
            accept-orf
exit exit
```

For a specific BGP neighbor:
```
configure router bgp group <group-name> neighbor <ip-address>
    outbound-route-filtering
        extended-community
            accept-orf
exit exit
```
