To disable BGP passive mode for a specific neighbor in a Nokia router, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
group <group-name>
neighbor <ip-address>
no passive
exit
exit
exit
```

Replace `<group-name>` with the name of the BGP group containing the neighbor, and `<ip-address>` with the IP address of the specific neighbor. The `no passive` command will disable passive mode for that neighbor.
