## User question:
How to enable automatic adjustment of TCP session MTU based on ICMP feedback in Nokia routers to avoid IP fragmentation?
---
## Proposed answer:
To enable automatic adjustment of TCP session MTU based on ICMP feedback in Nokia routers, use the following CLI configuration command:

```
configure router bgp path-mtu-discovery
```

This command enables Path MTU Discovery for BGP TCP connections, allowing the router to adjust the MTU dynamically based on ICMP feedback to avoid IP fragmentation.
---
