To configure the Nokia router's BGP next-hop resolution to use the route policy 'core-routes' for filtering eligible IP routes, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router
    bgp
        next-hop-resolution
            labeled-routes
                transport-tunnel family ipv4 resolution-filter core-routes
```

This configuration applies the 'core-routes' policy to filter eligible IPv4 routes for BGP next-hop resolution under the labeled-routes context.
------------
As a network device expert, please determine whether the following answer correctly responds to the user's question based on the router configuration manual. Only output "Correct" or "Incorrect" without any explanation or additional information. You must make your own judgment based on the Router configuration manual provided to you, not on your own knowledge.
