To configure BGP next-hop resolution for labeled routes with transport tunnels in Nokia routers, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        labeled-routes
            transport-tunnel
                family ipv4
                    resolution filter
                    resolution-filter bgp ldp rsvp sr-isis sr-ospf sr-policy sr-te
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
exit
```

This configuration:
1. Enters the BGP context
2. Configures next-hop resolution for labeled routes
3. Enables transport tunnel usage
4. Specifies IPv4 family (adjust to ipv6 if needed)
5. Sets resolution mode to 'filter' (you can also use 'any')
6. Defines which tunnel types to consider (BGP, LDP, RSVP, Segment Routing variants)
7. Exits all contexts

Adjust the tunnel types in the resolution-filter based on your specific requirements.
