Replace `[tunnel-types]` with the specific tunnel types you want to allow (e.g., `bgp`, `ldp`, `rsvp`, `sr-isis`, `sr-ospf`, `sr-policy`, or `sr-te`). For example, if you only want to allow BGP and RSVP tunnels:

```
