To enable sending both pre-policy and post-policy route monitoring messages on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router bgp monitor
    route-monitoring pre-policy post-policy
exit
```

If you need to apply this at a specific BGP group or neighbor level, navigate to the respective context first:

For a BGP group:
```
configure router bgp group <group-name> monitor
    route-monitoring pre-policy post-policy
exit
```

For a BGP neighbor:
```
configure router bgp group <group-name> neighbor <ip-address> monitor
    route-monitoring pre-policy post-policy
exit
```
