To configure a Nokia router to accept or advertise BGP routes only with the route target community value of `65001:12345`, use the following CLI commands:

```cli
configure router bgp
    route-target-list target:65001:12345
exit
```

This configuration ensures that only routes containing the specified route target community (`65001:12345`) will be accepted or advertised by the BGP process.
