To configure the Nokia router to use the routing instance 'customer_vpn_12' for connecting to the BMP monitoring station, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure
    bmp
        station <station-name>
            connection
                router customer_vpn_12
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

Replace `<station-name>` with the actual name of your BMP monitoring station. This configuration sets the routing instance for the BMP station connection to 'customer_vpn_12'.
