To configure BGP next-hop resolution for labeled routes to use the IGP route table lookup instead of tunnel signaling protocols, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        labeled-routes
            rr-use-route-table
        exit
    exit
exit
```

This configuration enables the router to resolve BGP next-hops for labeled routes by performing a lookup in the IGP route table rather than relying on tunnel signaling protocols.
