To configure Nokia routers to use RSVP tunnels with the best metric for BGP next-hop resolution, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        shortcut-tunn family ipv4
            resolution-filter rsvp
        exit
        labeled-routes transport-tunnel family ipv4
            resolution-filter rsvp
        exit
    exit
exit
```

This configuration ensures BGP uses the RSVP tunnel with the best metric for next-hop resolution. If multiple RSVP LSPs have the same lowest metric, BGP will select the one with the lowest tunnel ID.
