To configure the Nokia router to negotiate BGP ORF send capability for the specified route target extended community, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    group <group-name>
        outbound-route-filtering
            extended-community
                send-orf target:192.0.2.10:65535
```

Replace `<group-name>` with your specific BGP group name where this configuration should be applied. This will enable the router to negotiate the send capability for the specified route target extended community in BGP ORF negotiations with its peer.
