To configure a Nokia router to include link-bandwidth extended community in unlabeled unicast IPv4 routes advertised to EBGP peers, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure
router
    bgp
        group <group-name>
            link-bandwidth
                send-to-ebgp ipv4
            exit
        exit
    exit
exit
```

Replace `<group-name>` with your BGP group name. This configuration will enable sending link-bandwidth extended communities for unlabeled IPv4 routes to all EBGP peers in the specified group.
