To enable the context for configuring tunnel types to resolve unlabeled IPv4/IPv6 BGP routes under next-hop resolution, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp next-hop-resolution shortcut-tunnel
family ipv4
exit
family ipv6
exit
```

These commands create the context for configuring next-hop resolution of unlabeled IPv4 and IPv6 BGP routes via shortcut tunnels. You can then specify the tunnel types within each family context as needed.
