To enable Segment Routing tunnels from IS-IS instances for BGP next-hop resolution on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router
    bgp
        next-hop-resolution
            shortcut-tunnel
                family ipv4
                    resolution-filter sr-isis
                exit
            exit
            labeled-routes
                transport-tunnel
                    family ipv4
                        resolution-filter sr-isis
                    exit
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

This configuration enables SR-ISIS tunnels for both unlabeled IPv4 routes (under `shortcut-tunnel`) and labeled IPv4 routes (under `labeled-routes`). Adjust the family type (`ipv4` or `ipv6`) as needed for your specific requirements.
