To configure BGP to use Segment Routing tunnels from the lowest preference IS-IS instance for next-hop resolution, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        shortcut-tunnels
            family ipv4
                resolution filter
                resolution-filter sr-isis
```

This configuration:
1. Enables next-hop resolution for BGP
2. Configures shortcut tunnels for IPv4 family
3. Sets the resolution mode to 'filter' to restrict tunnel types
4. Specifies only IS-IS Segment Routing tunnels ('sr-isis') as valid for next-hop resolution

The router will automatically select the lowest preference IS-IS instance when multiple instances are available.
