How to configure Nokia routers to allow BGP to use Segment Routing tunnels from the lowest preference OSPF instance for next-hop resolution?
---
## Proposed answer:
To configure BGP to use Segment Routing tunnels from the lowest preference OSPF instance for next-hop resolution, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router
    bgp
        next-hop-resolution
            shortcut-tunn family ipv4
                resolution-filter sr-ospf
            exit
            labeled-routes transport-tunnel family ipv4
                resolution-filter sr-ospf
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

For IPv6, replace `sr-ospf` with `sr-ospf3` in the above configuration.
