To enable Segment Routing tunnel selection by TE instances for BGP next-hop resolution on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router
    bgp
        next-hop-resolution
            shortcut-tunn family ipv4
                resolution-filter sr-te
            exit
            labeled-routes transport-tunnel family ipv4
                resolution-filter sr-te
            exit
        exit
    exit
exit
```

This configuration enables SR-TE tunnel selection for both unlabeled BGP routes (under `shortcut-tunn`) and labeled BGP routes (under `labeled-routes`). The TE instance will now be considered for BGP next-hop resolution.
