            connection
                station-address <ip-address> port <port>
                no shutdown
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

Replace `<ip-address>` with the actual IP address of your BMP monitoring station and `<port>` with the desired TCP port number. Optionally, you can also add these configurations under the connection context if needed:
- `local-address <ip-address>` (to specify a local source IP)
- `router <router-instance>` (to specify a routing instance)

For example, with additional optional parameters:
```
configure
    bmp
        station "NYC-DC1"
            connection
                station-address 192.0.2.100 port 12345
                local-address 203.0.113.5
                router Base
                no shutdown
            exit
        exit
    exit
```
