To enable UDP tunnel selection for BGP next-hop resolution of labeled routes on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router
    bgp
        next-hop-resolution
            labeled-routes
                transport-tunnel family ipv4
                    resolution-filter
                        udp
                    exit
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
``` 

This configuration enables UDP tunnel selection in the Tunnel Table Manager (TTM) for BGP next-hop resolution of labeled IPv4 routes.
