To configure a Nokia router to apply base instance BGP export route policies to VPN-IPv4/6 and EVPN routes, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    vpn-apply-export
exit
```

This command must be executed under the BGP context (`config>router>bgp`). It will apply the base instance BGP export route policies to VPN-IPv4, VPN-IPv6, and EVPN routes.
