To configure a Nokia router to apply base instance BGP export route policies to VPN-related routes including vpn-ipv4/6 and EVPN, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    vpn-apply-export
exit
```

This command can also be applied at the BGP group or neighbor level if needed:

```
configure router bgp group <group-name>
    vpn-apply-export
exit
```

or

```
configure router bgp group <group-name> neighbor <ip-address>
    vpn-apply-export
exit
```
