To enable weighted selection of RSVP-TE tunnels for 6PE traffic forwarding based on normalized load-balancing weights, use the following CLI configuration:

```
configure router
    bgp
        next-hop-resolution
            weighted-ecmp
            exit
            labeled-routes
                transport-tunnel
                    family label-ipv6
                        resolution-filter rsvp
                        exit
                    exit
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

This configuration:
1. Enables weighted ECMP for next-hop tunnel selection (`weighted-ecmp`)
2. Configures label-ipv6 family for 6PE traffic
3. Sets RSVP-TE as the resolution filter for tunnel selection
