## Proposed answer:
To enable weighted load balancing for 6PE traffic over RSVP-TE tunnels on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        weighted-ecmp
        exit
    exit
```

This configuration enables weighted ECMP for next-hop tunnel selection, which will distribute 6PE traffic across RSVP-TE tunnels based on their normalized load-balancing weights.
